1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,079
A home screen that knows your face. What
does it keep when you leave?

2
00:00:07,029 --> 00:00:12,507
Your messages and calendar: its maker says
they're not stored on it.

3
00:00:13,457 --> 00:00:18,936
Your face? It says nobody can see it. How
long it's kept: not said.

4
00:00:19,886 --> 00:00:25,364
Its own ad ends with the family watching the
daughter's boyfriend leave on its camera.

5
00:00:26,214 --> 00:00:31,943
It forgets your data when you leave. And
your guests?
